    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node Strike is a third person action game where enemies are defeated by solving puzzles. Throughout the game, players will encounter enemies that are protected by a matrix of symbols of nodes. The player must determine the order in which to destroy them while dodging attacks and then destroy all the nodes to defeat the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 node types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a speed-running medal system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new abilities and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >about 90-120 minutes of gameplay</p></li></ul>",
